To select every 7th element with a specific class and apply a different background color to each selected element, you can use the `:nth-of-type` selector in CSS. To add a fade-in animation effect, you can use the `@keyframes` rule along with the `animation` property. Lastly, to conditionally apply the fade-in animation only on mobile devices, you can use a media query.

